# Frontend features

## Layout

```
apps/frontend/src/
  routes/                 # thin only
  features/<name>/        # page UI, hooks, feature helpers
  shared/ui/              # cross-feature components
  shared/lib/             # trpc client, env, format
```

## Thin routes

```tsx
// ✅ routes/torrents.tsx
export const Route = createFileRoute("/torrents")({
  component: () => <TorrentsPage />,
});

// ❌ No forms, tables, trpc hooks, or private subcomponents in route files
```

Pass `$id` / search params from the route into the page as props. Features should not read router internals directly.

## Feature rules

- One feature folder per product area: `search`, `torrents`, `title`, `settings`, `home`.
- Colocate data hooks (`useTorrentList`, …) and invalidation with the feature.
- Do not import another feature. Promote shared pieces to `shared/ui` or `shared/lib`.
- Keep `shared/lib/trpc.ts` as the client only — no feature queries there.

## Migration

When touching a god route (`torrents.tsx`, `title.$id.tsx`, `settings.tsx`), extract into `features/<name>/` instead of growing the route file. Prefer the existing `components/search/` pattern as the target shape under `features/`.
